{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(＊･ω･＊)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/03/2259965/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月、みなさんどうお過ごしですか\\( ^ω^ )/⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるはねー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"両方のおばあちゃんちに行ったり\nいとこと遊んだり\nアウトレットに行ったり\n福袋を買ったり\nバックを買ってもらったり\nお買い物したり\n親戚の集まりに行ったり\n(良三おじさんや、はとこもいた！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もーんのすごく充実してました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/03/2259965/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくりまったりしたり、\n楽しく遊んだり、\n最高だったーーー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日、１月３日は、\nままの誕生日(*´˘`*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままはね、いつも帰りが遅くなったときも\n疲れてるはずなのに必ず起きてて待っててくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしいご飯を作って待っててくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝がめっちゃ早いときも必ず起こして見送ってくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか申し訳ないんだけどすごくありがたくてほんと感謝してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。まま。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつまでも若くてきれいで優しくて\n姉妹みたいね！\nって言われる、ちょっと照れ臭いけど\nそんな自慢のお母さんでいてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まま大好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/03/2259965/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてみなさん、いつもありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/03/2259965/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほら、感謝の気持ちを伝えたくて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでよくみて！よーくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「喜」ってゆー字に見えるでしょ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん。見えないかなー？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、見て！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜び！喜び！\nありがとう！ありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ\\( ^ω^ )/\n下手でごめん\\( ^ω^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、この一年は、\nちはるーむめいとの皆さんとの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/03/2259965/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を大事にしたいなーヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/03/2259965/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年にするぞ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ\\( ^ω^ )/\n下手でごめんなさい\\( ^ω^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってかあれねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書き初め載せる！って言ってたくせに\n載せられなかったよー(´;_; `)ごめん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹が半紙いっぱい使ってたみたいで足りなくなってしまった(•ө•)おーのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから普通の半紙に書いてしまったよ！(•ө•)ぴよぴよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさいねー(´;_; `)(´;_; `)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/03/2259965/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５日、６日は今年初めての個別と全握だね\\( ^ω^ )/！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんと同じのレーンかな⁇\nななみんふぁんの方よろしくお願いします＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年最初のみなさんの元気な姿に会うの楽しみにしてまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/03/2259965/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/03/2259965/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっかり美味しいもの食べて\nいっぱい寝て\nのーんびり過ごしたから\n体のコンディション抜群(✪‿✪)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえい(✪‿✪)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/03/2259965/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはどうですかねー⁇\n元気かしらー⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´>∀<｀)ゝ"}],"source":"archive"}